KNOWNBUG
main.cpp
--cpp11
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ auto&& binds a const lvalue: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
auto&& initialized from a const lvalue deduces the non-reference type
(missing the [temp.deduct.call]/3 lvalue rule) and fails to bind;
breaks forwarding-reference function templates called with const
lvalues (for_each_instruction_if in the restrict_function_pointers
dog-food TU).
